# VigiRail web — build-time configuration (optional)
#
# Leave empty in the default setup: the browser calls same-origin /api and
# the host (Vercel rewrites / nginx in docker-compose) proxies to the API.
#
# Set VITE_API_URL only when the API is on a different origin AND the backend
# allows that origin via VIGIRAIL_CORS_ORIGINS, e.g.:
VITE_API_URL=
